# Generated native projects.
#   • iOS IS committed so Info.plist (WKAppBoundDomains, privacy strings) and
#     signing config persist for App Store builds + CI. Generate it once on a
#     Mac with `npm run init:ios`, then `git add platform/mobile/ios`.
#     (Capacitor writes its own ios/.gitignore for Pods/, build/, DerivedData.)
#   • Android is still regenerated on demand — commit it too when you ship Play.
android/
node_modules/
package-lock.json

# Capacitor scratch
.capacitor/
*.log
